/* ================================================================== CAMPAIGN: FIRST HARVEST (the missions)
   Three weeks before Blackwell. JUNE ALVAREZ drives for the Green Coast Collective, a legal weed co-op run by MARA.
   Lazarus Pharma wants the co-op's land and its strains; its private army VANTAGE comes to take them. June runs, gets
   framed, and finds the four people who will be in Blackwell the night it falls: Smokes, Doc, Tank and Sparks.
   Every mission has its own tasks (see camp.js for what each step type does). Coordinates are the map's own. */

